* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB1 VB2 VREF VB4 IBUF VB3 VIN FB VOUT
CL VOUT net3 1p
M1 net4 net8 VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
